    "winnerId": "dragonfly",
    "headline": "Dragonfly led every section; Redis and Valkey tracked within a few percent of each other",
    "summary": "Dragonfly 1.40.1 (64 threads) reached 1.20M ops/s on small-value SET/GET — 6.9x Redis's 174K ops/s, at 0.33 ms p99 vs 2.09 ms. Pipeline depth 30 widened the gap to 8.8x (12.8M vs 1.45M ops/s). Large values closed to 1.9x, likely network-limited. Dragonfly also used 29% less RSS per key. Redis 8.8.2 and Valkey 9.1.1 tracked within 1% of each other on SET/GET workloads and within 8% on pipelining."
  },
